{"id":"vd-a2-the-surprise-party","level":"a2","n":29,"title":{"en":"Who's Going to Buy the Balloons?","vi":"Ai sẽ mua bóng bay?"},"summary":"Tối muộn trong bếp, Hannah và Luis thì thầm lên kế hoạch cho bữa tiệc bất ngờ — chia việc, nhắc nhau và lo những tình huống \"nếu như\".","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-surprise-party","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Surprise Party","vi":"Bữa tiệc bất ngờ"}},"scene":{"background":"kitchen","props":[{"id":"notebook","x":800},{"id":"gift-box","x":1330,"y":610,"scale":0.85}]},"cast":{"hannah":{"name":{"en":"Hannah","vi":"Hannah"},"look":"teengirl","x":500,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#2B1B14","skin":"#A8704C","skinShade":"#8E5C3C","outfit":"tee","top":"#E4572E","topShade":"#C94A24"}},"luis":{"name":{"en":"Luis","vi":"Luis"},"look":"boy","x":1120,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#2B1B14","skin":"#A8704C","skinShade":"#8E5C3C","outfit":"tee","top":"#2E86AB","topShade":"#246E8D"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"hannah","en":"Shh! Is Nana asleep?","vi":"Suỵt! Bà ngủ chưa?","ipa":["ʃ","ɪz","ˈnænə","əˈslip"],"start":0.554,"end":2.424,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.406],[2,1.569],[3,1.936]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"Yes. I can hear her in her room.","vi":"Rồi. Em nghe thấy tiếng bà trong phòng.","ipa":["jɛs","aɪ","kæn","hiɹ","hɝ","ɪn","hɝ","ɹum"],"start":3.214,"end":5.034,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,3.214],[1,3.961],[2,4.058],[3,4.178],[4,4.382],[5,4.526],[6,4.61],[7,4.767]]},{"speaker":"hannah","en":"Good. OK, we need to plan the party.","vi":"Tốt. Được rồi, mình cần lên kế hoạch cho bữa tiệc.","ipa":["ɡʊd","oʊˈkeɪ","wi","nid","tu","plæn","ðə","ˈpɑɹti"],"start":5.824,"end":8.284,"gesture":"explain","prop":"notebook","timing":[[0,5.824],[1,6.526],[2,6.73],[3,6.88],[4,7.111],[5,7.246],[6,7.573],[7,7.695]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"Who's going to invite the guests?","vi":"Ai sẽ lo mời khách đến dự?","ipa":["huz","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","ˌɪnˈvaɪt","ðə","ɡɛsts"],"start":9.074,"end":10.324,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,9.074],[1,9.186],[2,9.343],[3,9.439],[4,9.739],[5,9.811]]},{"speaker":"hannah","en":"I'll do that. I've got all her friends' numbers.","vi":"Chị lo việc đó. Chị có số điện thoại của tất cả bạn bè bà.","ipa":["aɪl","du","ðæt","aɪv","ɡɑt","ɔl","hɝ","fɹɛndz","ˈnʌmbɚz"],"start":11.114,"end":14.084,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,11.114],[1,11.194],[2,11.425],[3,12.281],[4,12.403],[5,12.634],[6,12.852],[7,13.028],[8,13.45]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"And who's going to buy the balloons?","vi":"Thế ai sẽ mua bóng bay?","ipa":["ənd","huz","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","baɪ","ðə","bəˈlunz"],"start":14.874,"end":16.244,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,14.874],[1,14.934],[2,15.163],[3,15.319],[4,15.391],[5,15.535],[6,15.631]]},{"speaker":"hannah","en":"You are. And you can make the sign, too.","vi":"Em chứ ai. Em làm luôn tấm biển nhé.","ipa":["ju","ɑɹ","ənd","ju","kæn","meɪk","ðə","saɪn","tu"],"start":17.034,"end":19.674,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,17.034],[1,17.203],[2,17.964],[3,18.072],[4,18.222],[5,18.399],[6,18.643],[7,18.752],[8,19.227]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"OK. I'll buy forty balloons!","vi":"Được. Em sẽ mua bốn mươi quả bóng bay!","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","aɪl","baɪ","ˈfɔɹti","bəˈlunz"],"start":20.464,"end":22.304,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","timing":[[0,20.464],[1,21.161],[2,21.269],[3,21.414],[4,21.726]]},{"speaker":"hannah","en":"Forty? Where are you going to hide them?","vi":"Bốn mươi á? Em định giấu chúng ở đâu?","ipa":["ˈfɔɹti","wɛɹ","ɑɹ","ju","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","haɪd","ðɛm"],"start":23.094,"end":25.464,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,23.094],[1,24.01],[2,24.173],[3,24.268],[4,24.404],[5,24.635],[6,24.73],[7,25.097]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"Under my bed. Nana never looks there.","vi":"Dưới gầm giường em. Bà chẳng bao giờ nhìn chỗ đó.","ipa":["ˈʌndɚ","maɪ","bɛd","ˈnænə","ˈnɛvɚ","lʊks","ðɛɹ"],"start":26.254,"end":28.214,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,26.254],[1,26.398],[2,26.519],[3,27.24],[4,27.444],[5,27.684],[6,27.913]]},{"speaker":"hannah","en":"Fine. Mom and Dad are going to take her to the cinema.","vi":"Được thôi. Bố mẹ sẽ đưa bà đi xem phim.","ipa":["faɪn","mɑm","ənd","dæd","ɑɹ","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","teɪk","hɝ","tu","ðə","ˈsɪnəmə"],"start":29.004,"end":32.304,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,29.004],[1,29.821],[2,30.107],[3,30.216],[4,30.542],[5,30.637],[6,30.854],[7,30.963],[8,31.248],[9,31.384],[10,31.561],[11,31.683]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"What if she doesn't want to go?","vi":"Nếu bà không muốn đi thì sao?","ipa":["wʌt","ɪf","ʃi","ˈdʌzənt","wɑnt","tu","ɡoʊ"],"start":33.094,"end":34.104,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,33.094],[1,33.178],[2,33.25],[3,33.383],[4,33.623],[5,33.755],[6,33.803]]},{"speaker":"hannah","en":"She loves films. She'll go.","vi":"Bà mê phim lắm. Bà sẽ đi thôi.","ipa":["ʃi","lʌvz","fɪlmz","ʃil","ɡoʊ"],"start":34.894,"end":37.104,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,34.894],[1,35.026],[2,35.38],[3,36.333],[4,36.686]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"What if she finds out?","vi":"Nếu bà phát hiện ra thì sao?","ipa":["wʌt","ɪf","ʃi","faɪndz","aʊt"],"start":37.894,"end":38.734,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,37.894],[1,37.942],[2,38.014],[3,38.135],[4,38.471]]},{"speaker":"hannah","en":"She won't. But don't forget: not a word to anyone at school!","vi":"Không đâu. Nhưng đừng quên: không hé răng với ai ở trường đấy!","ipa":["ʃi","woʊnt","bʌt","doʊnt","fɚˈɡɛt","nɑt","ə","wɝd","tu","ˈɛniˌwʌn","æt","skul"],"start":39.524,"end":44.134,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,39.524],[1,39.764],[2,40.702],[3,40.838],[4,41.096],[5,42.237],[6,42.482],[7,42.577],[8,42.849],[9,42.998],[10,43.433],[11,43.569]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"I promise. I'm very good at secrets.","vi":"Em hứa. Em giữ bí mật giỏi lắm.","ipa":["aɪ","ˈpɹɑməs","aɪm","ˈvɛɹi","ɡʊd","æt","ˈsikɹəts"],"start":44.924,"end":47.034,"expression":"happy","react":{"hannah":"thinking"},"timing":[[0,44.924],[1,44.962],[2,45.864],[3,45.96],[4,46.188],[5,46.344],[6,46.429]]}],"words":[{"id":"invite","en":"invite","ipa":"ˌɪnˈvaɪt","vi":"mời; mời gọi","level":1},{"id":"guest","en":"guest","ipa":"ɡɛst","vi":"khách; khách mời","level":0},{"id":"balloon","en":"balloon","ipa":"bəˈlun","vi":"bóng bay; khinh khí cầu","level":1},{"id":"forget","en":"forget","ipa":"fɚˈɡɛt","vi":"quên; quên mất","level":0},{"id":"cinema","en":"cinema","ipa":"ˈsɪnəmə","vi":"rạp chiếu phim; điện ảnh","level":0},{"id":"hide","en":"hide","ipa":"haɪd","vi":"giấu; trốn; che giấu","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Lên kế hoạch và chia việc","pattern":"We need to … · Who's going to …? · I'll … · Don't forget to … · What if …?","explain":"\"Be going to\" nói việc đã định sẵn: \"Who's going to buy…?\". \"I'll…\" nhận việc ngay lúc nói: \"I'll make the sign.\" Nhắc việc: \"Don't forget to + động từ\". Tính tình huống: \"What if she finds out?\" (nếu… thì sao?).","keys":["we need to","who's going to","i'll","don't forget to","what if"],"lines":[2,3,4,5,7,11,13]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-surprise-party.mp3","v":"c0c6b1ab14","duration":48.12,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}